{"4295990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gauntleteer", "steam_appid": 4295990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/2697fa425014bb5adfca6844ba32261c.avif?t=1775869186\" width=634 height=303 /></span><br><br><strong>Gauntleteer</strong> is a top-down action-adventure RPG inspired by the likes of <i>Mario &amp; Luigi: Superstar Saga</i> and <i>Deltarune</i>, featuring a battle system akin to classic 2D shoot-em-ups! All set in the exciting, hand-drawn world of Aurelia!<br><br> <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/ae91c9c38c6bf78f843be5b860b1b92b.avif?t=1775869186\" width=1520 height=225 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/dbe0d301dac0e1162d00d2d6d24296a7.poster.avif?t=1775869186\" aria-label=\"Kirborbie, the protagonist!\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/dbe0d301dac0e1162d00d2d6d24296a7.webm?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/dbe0d301dac0e1162d00d2d6d24296a7.mp4?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Kirborbie</strong> is a blue blob-like creature that you'll play as in your time in <strong>Aurelia!</strong> He's crash landed in the strange new land, and he meets new colorful characters and challenges deadly foes... But what's with that strange <strong>Gauntlet</strong> he has in place of his arm...?<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/35d828e9fa56af621832f52c0073dc60.avif?t=1775869186\" width=1520 height=225 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/f919b4b1ef7663c6f34a43dc16f65982.poster.avif?t=1775869186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/f919b4b1ef7663c6f34a43dc16f65982.webm?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/f919b4b1ef7663c6f34a43dc16f65982.mp4?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In this fully hand-drawn world, there's secrets and surprises around every corner! But don't let your guard down...!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/85ea648de2bf0ba4a79588fd71bbc044.avif?t=1775869186\" width=1520 height=225 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/67cdacf98ed55e626e1790622e3b083f.poster.avif?t=1775869186\" aria-label=\"A battle against a fierce boss!\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/67cdacf98ed55e626e1790622e3b083f.webm?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/67cdacf98ed55e626e1790622e3b083f.mp4?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Along the way, you'll face highly difficult <i>Cuphead</i>-inspired Shoot-'em-up battles in exciting bullet-hell chaos! <br>Battles in Gauntleteer aren't like your traditional turn-based RPGs; Instead, every fight throws you directly into fast-paced, skill-heavy, bullet-hell combat based on shoot-'em-ups inspired by the classics!<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/3a8c2e9637b2f02ac73e3f146ba857e0.avif?t=1775869186\" width=1520 height=225 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/0c421e1b9f125921e97bc729f1193be3.poster.avif?t=1775869186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/0c421e1b9f125921e97bc729f1193be3.webm?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/0c421e1b9f125921e97bc729f1193be3.mp4?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Leveling up grants Badge Points, allowing you to equip powerful Badges that change how you play. Whether it's drastic or minor, you can increase your HP, unlock new abilities, upgrade your weapons, customization... or something just plain stupid! There's something for every person, every build!... Even if it's terrible!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/a6622c5f9c15ee39a6c7a36b776afa43.avif?t=1775869186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras_big/a6622c5f9c15ee39a6c7a36b776afa43.webp?t=1775869186 width=1560 height=177 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/dc74078fcd9a4a2eab4b4dbbf1ed41e9.poster.avif?t=1775869186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/dc74078fcd9a4a2eab4b4dbbf1ed41e9.webm?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/dc74078fcd9a4a2eab4b4dbbf1ed41e9.mp4?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Aurelia</strong> is full of strange, silly, fun (and sometimes even borderline unbearable) <strong>characters</strong>! Some are helpful, some are fun! Some are suspicious... others are very dangerous. <br>And some just probably shouldn’t ever see the light of day ever again. Sorry, but it's true.<br><br>Every character has their own personality, humor, and role to play in Kirborbie’s journey. But never judge a book by its cover...!<br> <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/dd9e7e54e45996e13b014ee78615a154.avif?t=1775869186\" width=588 height=225 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/6445765fe282961f56354463bf017396.avif?t=1775869186\" width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/c7566483026515b3db7da8026d3aaf2e.avif?t=1775869186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras_big/c7566483026515b3db7da8026d3aaf2e.webp?t=1775869186 width=1560 height=655 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a