ras/dc74078fcd9a4a2eab4b4dbbf1ed41e9.mp4?t=1775869186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Aurelia</strong> is full of strange, silly, fun (and sometimes even borderline unbearable) <strong>characters</strong>! Some are helpful, some are fun! Some are suspicious... others are very dangerous. <br>And some just probably shouldn’t ever see the light of day ever again. Sorry, but it's true.<br><br>Every character has their own personality, humor, and role to play in Kirborbie’s journey. But never judge a book by its cover...!<br> <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/dd9e7e54e45996e13b014ee78615a154.avif?t=1775869186\" width=588 height=225 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/6445765fe282961f56354463bf017396.avif?t=1775869186\" width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras/c7566483026515b3db7da8026d3aaf2e.avif?t=1775869186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/extras_big/c7566483026515b3db7da8026d3aaf2e.webp?t=1775869186 width=1560 height=655 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Blast through the world of Aurelia as Kirborbie! Meet colorful characters and face 2D platformer skill-heavy bullet-hell battles. The RPG where every enemy is a boss!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/d6444926a126de2d7c85b39535d17ce3bea23ccd/header.jpg?t=1775869186", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4295990/98ce01dd251d536a786f45be36e8cc1358e7dfd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775869186", "capsule_imagev